The Netgear R6080 is a dual band WiFi router supporting AC1000 Wi-Fi - 300+700 Mbps (2.4 and 5 GHz) speeds. The router has 2 non-detachable antennas and a 10/100 FastEthernet switch. It is similar to the [[toh:netgear:r6120|Netgear R6120]], but lacks the USB port and has only 8 MiB of internal flash memory.

